{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The year is 2001. In your email, you receive the Demo build of <strong>Iskabon</strong>, a new game from POi Interactive. You download the game. And...well something goes horribly wrong. The game's code and your computer has somehow merged. And the only way to get your computer back is by completing the game!\u00a0</i><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/4cbd2895775f758fe7183275410f0c5b.poster.avif?t=1771563278\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/4cbd2895775f758fe7183275410f0c5b.webm?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/4cbd2895775f758fe7183275410f0c5b.mp4?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iskabon is a score chasing roguelike deckbuilder. As you progress, you build up your deck with newer cards that you unlock. Some cards affect other cards, some let you score higher, and some may even break the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But...Be careful of the <i>evil</i> card: <strong>The Iskabon</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round starts with you drawing blindly from a random selection of <i>face-down</i> cards from your deck, including <strong>Iskabons. </strong>Use special<i>\u00a0</i>\u2665\ufe0fItem cards or heck, rely on <strong>probability</strong> to avoid picking the <strong>Iskabons</strong>. Guess wrong and\u00a0<strong>Iskabon\u00a0</strong>will destroy all cards in your hand. Get hit by 5 <strong>Iskabons\u00a0</strong>during a run- and it's game over! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/aa0fe8f133f4456b14f79382ca61f582.poster.avif?t=1771563278\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/aa0fe8f133f4456b14f79382ca61f582.webm?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/aa0fe8f133f4456b14f79382ca61f582.mp4?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds end with you playing the cards you have picked. Every card's effect is applied and their values are added up. Your score is the <strong>Round Score</strong> multiplied by the <strong>Mult</strong>. Some cards affect the <strong>Score</strong>, some affect the <strong>Mult, </strong>while others<strong>\u00a0</strong>affect cards to their right- triggering compounding effect. So be sure to reorder cards before you play to maximize their impact, trigger synergies and score big.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/7235222e7682b7e165d3ee5e2afe1809.poster.avif?t=1771563278\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/7235222e7682b7e165d3ee5e2afe1809.webm?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/7235222e7682b7e165d3ee5e2afe1809.mp4?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock cards with various abilities as you progress through the run. Each run starts with a random starting deck, ensuring no two run are the exact same. Decide which cards to take and which ones to discard, build the ultimate deck and win the game.\u00a0The more cards you play the more cash you earn. The more risk you take the more you score. But you also risk losing it all. The best strategy is the one that works!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024470?t=1771563278","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024470?t=1771563278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/8f251f41fd09d0df3d70846100cc4697b38d0ce0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771563278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/8f251f41fd09d0df3d70846100cc4697b38d0ce0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771563278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4416800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The year is 2001. In your email, you receive the Demo build of <strong>Iskabon</strong>, a new game from POi Interactive. You download the game. And...well something goes horribly wrong. The game's code and your computer has somehow merged. And the only way to get your computer back is by completing the game!\u00a0</i><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/4cbd2895775f758fe7183275410f0c5b.poster.avif?t=1771563278\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/4cbd2895775f758fe7183275410f0c5b.webm?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024470/extras/4cbd2895775f758fe7183275410f0c5b.mp4?t=1771563278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >